    {"id": "C4", "text": "The housing stock characteristics and heating demand profiles in the cited studies are representative of the broader UK domestic sector."},
    {"id": "C5", "text": "The observed decarbonization of the UK electricity grid between 2014 and 2024 will persist or remain sufficiently low-carbon to sustain the reported operational advantages."}
